model base
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input pay: money PLN

def twice: money PLN = pay + pay at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 4 000.00 PLN "s"

ask q: twice law 2026-03-01
ask qx: twice in bad law 2026-03-01 as known 2026-09-01
